                <invention-title lang="de">VERFAHREN ZUR HERSTELLUNG EINER AUSGERICHTETEN GRENZFLÄCHENBESCHICHTUNG AUF SILICIUMCARBIDFASERN</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">PROCÉDÉ POUR FORMER UN REVÊTEMENT D'INTERFACE ALIGNÉ SUR DES FIBRES DE CARBURE DE SILICIUM</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">METHOD TO FORM ALIGNED INTERFACE COATING ON SILICON CARBIDE FIBERS</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A fibrous ceramic preform (20) includes a plurality of ceramic fibers (12), a first amorphous layer (14), and an interfacial coating layer (16). The interfacial coating layer (16) includes an anisotropic region (22) adjacent the at least one amorphous layer (14), and an isotropic region (24) on a side of the anisotropic region (22) opposite the at least one amorphous layer (14).</p>
            </abstract>
